---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import {business} from '../config/business';
---
<Layout title="Privacy — 4Ever Fit Lifestyle"><Header/><main class="privacy-content" id="main"><h1>Your enquiry.<br/>Your information.</h1><p><strong>Review version — September 2026</strong></p><p>This website is a design preview. Its consultation form runs in preview mode: the details you enter are used only to show a summary in your browser. The form does not send or save those details to a server.</p><h2>If you choose to email</h2><p>The “Open a draft” option prepares an email in your email app. You choose whether to send it. During testing, the recipient is <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>. This temporary address must be replaced before launch.</p><h2>What the form asks for</h2><p>Your name, email, location, preferred training format, fitness goal, and an optional message. Please do not include medical records or other sensitive health information.</p><h2>Website preferences</h2><p>The intro uses your browser’s session storage to remember that it has played. No advertising analytics have been added to this review build. Following the Instagram link opens a separate service with its own privacy practices.</p><h2>Before public launch</h2><p>The final contact address, submission provider, data retention arrangements, and privacy notice must be confirmed before live enquiries are enabled.</p><a class="text-link" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>Back to 4Ever Fit</a></main><Footer/></Layout>
